    <briefdescription>
<para>Finds the nearest common dominator of a set of BasicBlocks. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>For every BB you add to the set, you can specify whether we &quot;remember&quot; the block. When you get the common dominator, you can also ask whether it&apos;s one of the blocks we remembered. </para>
